  - [x] `seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/product-list/product-list.ts`: `RouterLink` aus `@angular/router` importieren, `imports: [CategoryNav, SortSelect, SearchBox, PropertyFilters, RouterLink]` ergänzen.
  - [x] `seed-b-frontend/src/app/features/catalog/product-list/product-list.html`: Produktname mit `routerLink` zur Detailansicht verlinken:
